      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful, thanks! Any ideas for sports or gentle activities that wouldn\u2019t stress a healing finger? I\u2019m usually outdoorsy.",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you help me figure out some options for sports to start while my finger heals?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For gentle activities that won't stress your healing finger, consider the following outdoor options:\n\n1. **Walking or Light Hiking**: Enjoy nature while keeping the intensity low to avoid straining your finger.\n2. **Birdwatching**: This can be a relaxing way to spend time outdoors without physical exertion.\n3. **Photography**: Capture the beauty around you; it allows for creativity and can be done at your own pace.\n4. **Gentle Stretching or Yoga**: Focus on lower body stretches or seated yoga poses that don\u2019t require much use of your hands.\n5. **Fishing**: If you enjoy it, you can do this with minimal hand strain, especially if you use gear that allows for easy handling.\n\nThese activities can help lift your mood while being mindful of your recovery.",
          "citations": {
