          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "If you're looking for outdoor or wild swimming near London, Hampstead Heath Bathing Ponds are a classic choice, offering separate men's, women's, and mixed ponds in a scenic setting [DOC-5]. Beckenham Place Park Swimming Lake is another excellent option, providing open-water swimming sessions with safety measures and induction for new swimmers [DOC-1][DOC-5]. The Royal Docks in East London offer open water swimming with pre-booked sessions and safety wristbands [DOC-5]. For more traditional outdoor pools, London also has several lidos, such as the Serpentine Lido in Hyde Park, though some may require membership or advance booking [DOC-3][DOC-5]. Always check the latest safety guidelines and booking requirements before visiting. Would you like more information on family-friendly swimming spots?",
