      {
        "turn": 7,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s useful, thanks. What about yoga? What budget should I consider for yoga?",
          "user_rubrik": "What budget should I consider for yoga?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For yoga, you can expect to pay around \u00a310-\u00a320 per class, depending on the studio and location. Some yoga studios in London offer introductory packages or discounts for new students, which can range from \u00a320-\u00a350 for a set number of classes. Monthly membership options are also available, which can cost anywhere from \u00a350-\u00a3150 per month, depending on the frequency of classes and amenities offered. Additionally, some gyms and fitness centers may include yoga classes as part of their membership packages. It's worth noting that some yoga studios also offer free or low-cost classes, especially for beginners or those with limited budgets.",
