          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming, preferably outdoors?",
          "user_rubrik": "Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Yes, there are several outdoor swimming spots near London. You could try Beckenham Place Park, which has a swimming lake that's been restored and is now open to the public. Alternatively, you could visit Hampstead Heath, which has several ponds that are suitable for wild swimming. If you're looking for something a bit more adventurous, you could try one of the many wild swimming spots along the rivers and lakes in the surrounding countryside. Just be sure to check the safety and accessibility of any spot before you go, and consider the current weather conditions.   Please let me know if I can help with anything else.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0025-02-05902:5": 2.077687978744507,
            "clueweb22-en0009-55-08812:0": 1.8713834285736084,
