          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Yeah, that\u2019s so true. Especially since I prefer being outdoors when it\u2019s warm. Are there simple things I could try at home, maybe with my kids, to lift everyone\u2019s spirits?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some ways to help someone that is feeling blue for a while?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "You can try simple activities like going on a color hunt with your kids, or engaging in some gentle stretching or movement together. Even small things like snuggling up in warm blankets, listening to music, or reading a book can help lift everyone's spirits. You can also try to get creative and find ways to make your small garden a fun place to be, even on cold days. The most important thing is to find activities that bring you and your kids joy and make you feel connected.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0016-21-00608:0": 3.0246260166168213,
            "clueweb22-en0006-96-02292:7": 2.7703261375427246,
