      {
        "turn": 3,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That sounds practical. I like the idea of using the garden somehow\u2014maybe we could do some easy gardening or setup a bird feeder? Also, do you think music really helps, or is it just a distraction?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some ways to help someone that is feeling blue for a while?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Music can indeed be helpful in lifting your mood and productivity. It's not just a distraction, but it can genuinely improve your focus and make tasks seem easier. You might find that listening to your favorite jazz music while doing some light gardening or setting up a bird feeder with your kids can make the experience even more enjoyable and help create a positive atmosphere. Give it a try and see how it works for you and your family!",
