          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are several wild swimming spots near London that you might enjoy. One option is Beckenham Place Park, which has a beautiful lake that's perfect for a dip. Another option is Frensham Great Pond, which is a bit further out but offers clear and shallow waters. If you're looking for something a bit more urban, you could try the West Reservoir Centre in Hackney, which has a large open-water area. Just be sure to check the safety and accessibility of each spot before you go, especially with your injured finger.",
