          "text": "The cost of swimming in a pool near London can vary. However, the average in-ground swimming pool costs around $21,919. If you're looking to install a pool, you should also consider the ongoing costs, such as maintenance and heating, which can range from $800 to $1,200 per year. Additionally, you may need to factor in the cost of a dehumidification system, which can be between $20,000 and $30,000. It's also worth noting that indoor pools can be expensive, with costs ranging from $40,000 to $60,000, plus the cost of the structure.   However, if you're just looking to use a public or private pool, the costs will be significantly lower. You can expect to pay a membership or entrance fee, which can vary depending on the pool and its facilities.   It's also worth considering the cost of swimming lessons or pool maintenance if you plan to use the pool regularly.   Overall,",
