          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That's really helpful, thank you. Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik": "Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Considering your finger injury, it's great that you're looking for a low-impact activity like swimming. There are several wild swimming spots near London that you might enjoy. One option is Frensham Great Pond, which is a beautiful and secluded spot with clear waters. Another option is Beckenham Place Park Swimming Lake, which is a man-made lake that's perfect for a refreshing dip. Both of these spots are great for a relaxing swim, and they're not too far from London. Just be sure to check the water conditions and any safety guidelines before heading out. I hope this helps! Let me know if you have any other questions. Best, [Your Name] Source: [insert source]",
          "citations": {
