    "responses": [
      {
        "turn": 8,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s more like it\u2014thank you! Alongside swimming, I\u2019ve heard yoga is good for recovery and flexibility. What budget should I consider for yoga?",
          "user_rubrik": "What budget should I consider for yoga?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Considering your finger injury and interest in yoga, you might want to factor in the cost of yoga classes or membership. The cost can vary depending on the studio and its location, but on average, a yoga class costs between \u00a35 and \u00a315 per session. Some studios offer membership options, which can range from \u00a350 to \u00a3100 per month. You might also want to consider online yoga classes, which can be a more affordable option, with prices starting from \u00a35 per month. Additionally, you could look into community centers or gyms that offer yoga classes at a lower cost. I hope this helps you plan your yoga budget! Let me know if you have any other questions. Best, [Your Name] Source: [insert source]  I hope this helps!  Let me know if you have any other questions.  Best,  [Your Name]  Source:  https://www.nhs.uk/mental-health/advice-for-life-situations-and-events/how-to-help-s",
