          "text": "The budget for swimming in a pool near London can vary depending on the location, type of pool, and membership options. Here are some general estimates: * Outdoor pools like London Fields Lido or Hampstead Heath Ponds: Free admission, but you may need to pay for parking or a small fee for amenities. * Indoor pools like London Aquatics Centre or Serpentine Lido: Day passes can cost around \u00a310-\u00a320, while membership options can range from \u00a350-\u00a3100 per month. * Private swimming clubs or gyms: Membership fees can range from \u00a350-\u00a3200 per month, depending on the facilities and services offered. * Swimming lessons or classes: Prices can vary depending on the instructor, location, and type of class, but expect to pay around \u00a310-\u00a320 per session.  Keep in mind that these are general estimates, and prices may vary depending on your specific location and preferences. It's always a good idea to check with the pool or facility",
