          "user_utterance": "Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik": "Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For swimming options near London that might be better for your finger recovery and preference for warmer water, consider these:\n\n*   **Oasis Sports Centre (West End):** Features a heavenly heated lido and an indoor pool.\n*   **London Fields Lido (Hackney):** Another heated outdoor swimming pool.\n*   **Fitness First Gyms:** Multiple locations across London (e.g., Baker Street, London Bridge) offer indoor pools, often complemented by hot spa pools.\n*   **The Porchester Spa:** Has a 30m pool and Turkish baths for warming up.\n*   **Balham Leisure Centre:** Offers a modern 25-meter indoor pool.",
