      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s quite a range. What kind of budget should I consider if I wanted to try yoga instead?",
          "user_rubrik": "What budget should I consider for yoga?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To try yoga, single group sessions at studios typically cost between $15 and $20. For private lessons, expect to pay $30 to $70 per session. If you plan to practice regularly, an average yoga practitioner spends about $90 a month. You can also start for free using online videos or apps, with a yoga mat costing around $20-30.",
