        "turn": 1,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Thanks, but I\u2019m the one asking today! About feeling blue\u2014are there good activities to lift someone\u2019s mood?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some ways to help someone that is feeling blue for a while?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To lift someone's mood, consider activities like taking a shower, practicing meditation, or going for a walk or swim. Engaging in creative pursuits such as painting, drawing, listening to music, or baking can also help. Spending time outdoors in nature, getting enough exercise and sleep, doing acts of kindness, or watching nostalgic shows are other great options.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0002-01-12191:1": 0.9618533849716187,
