          "user_utterance": "Nice, thanks! Can you help me figure out some options for sports to start while my finger heals?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you help me figure out some options for sports to start while my finger heals?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For alternative activities while your finger heals, consider options that avoid direct strain. Good choices include fast walking, jogging, hiking, dancing, aerobics, jumping rope, stair climbing, and jumping jacks. Cycling, swimming, and yoga are also excellent low-impact options. If you consider weight training or tennis, ensure exercises don't aggravate your finger. Always consult your doctor or physical therapist before starting new activities, especially given your slower recovery.",
