          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that helps! What kind of budget should I think about for swimming in a pool in or near London?",
          "user_rubrik": "What budget should I consider for swimming in a swimming pool near London?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For swimming in a pool in or near London, a single session can range from around \u00a35.35 at the London Aquatics Centre or \u00a36.15 at Oasis Sports Centre, up to \u00a310 at places like Balham Leisure Centre. Some higher-end spas or gyms might charge \u00a325-\u00a330 for a day pass.\n\nIf you're looking for regular swimming, monthly memberships typically start from about \u00a332-\u00a335 at leisure centres like Balham Leisure Centre or Oasis Sports Centre, and can go up to \u00a350-\u00a3100+ at various gyms across London.",
