          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s helpful! How does yoga compare in price?",
          "user_rubrik": "What budget should I consider for yoga?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For yoga in London, single classes typically range from around \u00a39 for online sessions to \u00a315-\u00a330 for in-studio classes. Monthly memberships vary significantly, from about \u00a36 for online access (with annual commitment) to \u00a324.99-\u00a335 for online unlimited access, and \u00a399-\u00a3200 for unlimited in-studio classes.\n\nCompared to swimming pool prices (single sessions \u00a35.35-\u00a310, monthly memberships \u00a332.50-\u00a3100+), yoga can be similarly priced for some online options but generally more expensive for in-studio classes and premium memberships.",
