          "user_utterance": "Thanks for asking! I\u2019m actually here to explore ideas about new activities and also ways to support someone feeling blue. Any thoughts or suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some ways to help someone that is feeling blue for a while?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For new activities, consider exploring hobbies like gardening or woodworking, joining a group gym class, or engaging in volunteer work. To support someone feeling down, encourage social interaction with friends and family, suggest physical activities like walks, or help them re-engage with hobbies they enjoy. Offering a listening ear, bringing food, or a comforting hug can also help. Additionally, consider suggesting professional support like counseling or a support group.",
