          "user_utterance": "Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik": "Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Yes, several water spots near London are great for swimming. Beckenham Place Park offers a lovely restored Georgian lake for wild swimming. West Reservoir in Hackney is a large site with open-water swimming sessions. The famous Hampstead Heath Bathing Ponds provide open-air swimming. You can also try Royal Docks in East London for open water swimming with a city view. Further out, Divers Cove Reservoir in Godstone is excellent for open-water swimming.",
