          "user_utterance": "Thanks for asking! I\u2019m okay at the moment. Actually, I\u2019m interested in learning about things to do when someone\u2019s feeling blue, maybe new activities or just general ideas. Any suggestions?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some ways to help someone that is feeling blue for a while?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "When feeling blue, consider trying activities like taking a shower, practicing meditation, or spending time outdoors. Engaging in creative activities, picking up a hobby, or watching a nostalgic show can also help. Connecting with friends, family, or even a pet, and performing acts of kindness are also suggested ways to lift your spirits.",
