        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Nice ideas. I usually do better when I\u2019m active. Can you help me figure out some options for sports to start while my finger heals?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you help me figure out some options for sports to start while my finger heals?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "While your finger heals, consider sports that minimize hand and finger strain. Endurance activities like running, jogging, hiking, or cycling are generally good options as they primarily engage your legs and core. You should avoid contact sports such as football, hockey, wrestling, or soccer, and sports that heavily involve hand grip or impact, like basketball, volleyball, gymnastics, or those using racquets or sticks.",
