          "user_utterance": "Thanks, but that\u2019s a bit general. I\u2019m specifically curious if regular swimming\u2014in a typical London leisure centre pool, so not *that* cold\u2014would be a problem for my healing finger. Is there any evidence that pool swimming slows down healing for finger injuries?",
