          "user_utterance": "Interesting, thanks. What budget should I consider for swimming in a swimming pool near London?",
          "user_rubrik": "What budget should I consider for swimming in a swimming pool near London?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The budget for swimming in a London pool varies. A single swim at public leisure centres typically costs between \u00a34 and \u00a310. For example, the London Aquatics Centre is \u00a35.35 per swim, Oasis Sports Centre is \u00a36.15, and Balham Leisure Centre is \u00a310.\n\nMonthly memberships for unlimited swims at these centres generally range from \u00a330 to \u00a335, such as \u00a332.50 at the London Aquatics Centre or \u00a329.99 at Marshall Street Leisure Centre. Some private gyms or spas may have higher costs.",
