      {
        "turn": 2,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Those all sound like solid ideas. Actually, while we\u2019re on this topic\u2014my finger\u2019s out of commission from climbing, but I still want to stay active. Can you help me figure out some options for sports to start while my finger heals?",
          "user_rubrik": "Can you help me figure out some options for sports to start while my finger heals?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To stay active while your finger heals, consider sports that don't heavily involve finger use. Hiking and jogging are excellent aerobic options that primarily use your legs. Football (soccer) could also be suitable as it's largely foot-based. Always listen to your body and avoid any activity that causes pain or puts stress on your injured finger to ensure proper healing.",
