            "2. - Lifestyle: Desires to maintain an active lifestyle even when their primary sport (climbing) is not possible.",
            "3. - Hobbies/Interests: Is currently experiencing a finger injury, likely a pulley strain, affecting their ability to climb.",
            "4. - Hobbies/Interests: Is highly motivated to continue climbing, even to the point of considering not fully resting an injury.",
            "5. - Personality: Expresses worry or concern about the implications of their finger injury, specifically regarding the potential for longer recovery periods and its impact on their ability to return to climbing.",
            "6. - Hobbies/Interests: Is interested in learning about finger injuries (likely related to their climbing hobby).",
            "7. - Hobbies/Interests: Seeks practical, detailed advice for managing their climbing injury, specifically interested in finger taping methods.",
            "8. I am climbing regularly for the past 3 years.",
            "9. I climb outdoors.",
            "10. - Hobbies/Interests: Practices specific climbing techniques, such as 'crimping'."
          ]
        }
