          "user_utterance": "Great, appreciate that. What budget should I consider for swimming in a swimming pool near London?",
          "user_rubrik": "What budget should I consider for swimming in a swimming pool near London?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "For a single swimming session in London, you can expect to pay between \u00a35.35 and \u00a330.75, depending on the venue. If you plan to swim regularly, monthly memberships typically range from \u00a332 to over \u00a3100. For example, the London Aquatics Centre offers one-off swims for \u00a35.35, with memberships from \u00a332.50/month, while other gyms like Rena London St. Pauls charge \u00a330 for a day pass or \u00a399.75/month.",
