          "user_utterance": "Thanks, I\u2019m actually looking for some ways to help someone who\u2019s feeling a bit blue. Any ideas?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are some ways to help someone that is feeling blue for a while?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "You could suggest they engage in self-care like taking a warm shower or ensuring they wear warm clothes. Encourage them to watch a nostalgic show, go for a walk, or get some sun exposure. Also, consider helping them improve their home environment or diet. If the blues persist, encourage them to talk to someone or seek professional help like a counsellor.",
