          "user_utterance": "I see, thanks for the detailed answer! Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik": "Do you know of any water spot near London to do swimming?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Yes, there are many water spots near London for swimming! You can find indoor pools at Fitness First gyms (e.g., Baker Street, Hammersmith) or the London Aquatics Centre. For outdoor options, consider lidos like Tooting Bec Lido, Oasis Sports Centre, or London Fields Lido. If you prefer open water, check out Hampstead Ponds, Serpentine Lake in Hyde Park, West Reservoir Centre, or Beckenham Place Park.",
