          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s thoughtful\u2014thank you! Actually, I was hoping to get some ideas specifically for new sports or physical activities I could start while letting a finger injury heal. Since I\u2019m used to climbing but need to go slow with the finger, is there something gentle but still engaging you\u2019d suggest?",
